                     * * * * * * * * * * * *

     We made only one minor acquisition during 1994 - a small=20
retail shoe chain - but our interest in finding good candidates=20
remains as keen as ever.  The criteria we employ for purchases or=20
mergers is detailed in the appendix on page 21.

     Last spring, we offered to merge with a large, family-
controlled business on terms that included a Berkshire convertible=20
preferred stock.  Though we failed to reach an agreement, this=20
episode made me realize that we needed to ask our shareholders to=20
authorize preferred shares in case we wanted in the future to move=20
quickly if a similar acquisition opportunity were to appear. =20
Accordingly, our proxy presents a proposal that you authorize a=20
large amount of preferred stock, which will be issuable on terms=20
set by the Board of Directors.  You can be sure that Charlie and I=20
will not use these shares without being completely satisfied that=20
we are receiving as much in intrinsic value as we are giving.

                     * * * * * * * * * * * *

     Charlie and I hope you can come to the Annual Meeting - at a=20
new site.  Last year, we slightly overran the Orpheum Theater's=20
seating capacity of 2,750, and therefore we will assemble at 9:30=20
a.m. on Monday, May 1, 1995, at the Holiday Convention Centre.  The=20
main ballroom at the Centre can handle 3,300, and if need be, we=20
will have audio and video equipment in an adjacent room capable of=20
handling another 1,000 people.

     Last year we displayed some of Berkshire's products at the=20
meeting, and as a result sold about 800 pounds of candy, 507 pairs=20
of shoes, and over $12,000 of World Books and related publications.=20
All these goods will be available again this year.  Though we like=20
to think of the meeting as a spiritual experience, we must remember=20
that even the least secular of religions includes the ritual of the=20
collection plate.

     Of course, what you really should be purchasing is a video=20
tape of the 1995 Orange Bowl.  Your Chairman views this classic=20
nightly, switching to slow motion for the fourth quarter.  Our=20
cover color this year is a salute to Nebraska's football coach, Tom=20
Osborne, and his Cornhuskers, the country's top college team.  I=20
urge you to wear Husker red to the annual meeting and promise you=20
that at least 50% of your managerial duo will be in appropriate=20
attire.

     We recommend that you promptly get hotel reservations for the=20
meeting, as we expect a large crowd.  Those of you who like to be=20
downtown (about six miles from the Centre) may wish to stay at the=20
Radisson Redick Tower, a small (88 rooms) but nice hotel or at the=20
much larger Red Lion Hotel a few blocks away.  In the vicinity of=20
the Centre are the Holiday Inn (403 rooms), Homewood Suites (118=20
rooms) and Hampton Inn (136 rooms).  Another recommended spot is=20
the Marriott, whose west Omaha location is about 100 yards from=20
Borsheim's and a ten-minute drive from the Centre.  There will be=20
buses at the Marriott that will leave at 8:45 and 9:00 for the=20
meeting and return after it ends.

     An attachment to our proxy material explains how you can=20
obtain the card you will need for admission to the meeting.  A=20
good-sized parking area is available at the Centre, while those who=20
stay at the Holiday Inn, Homewood Suites and Hampton Inn will be=20
